    "title": "Lake County Genealogical Society to hear about 'Using City Directories' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report editor@news-herald.com ,\n13 hours ago The Lake County Genealogical Society will meet virtually on Zoom at 10 a.m. March 26. Following a short business meeting, there will be a presentation on “Using City Directories in Genealogical Research” by guest speaker Cleveland native Deborah A. Abbott, who is specializing in genealogical methods, manuscript collections, and African American family research, according to a news release. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
